            <div xml:id="d270">

                <pb facs="0324" n="316" xml:id="pg316"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">841.24/1089a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Egypt</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Kirk</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-12-10T17:00:00-05:00">December 10, 1941—5
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>757. Mr. Hopkins has asked the Department to forward to you as further reply to
                    your 1896, December 4, the following text of a letter from the President to
                    Stettinius, Lend-Lease Administrator: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“For purposes of implementing the authority conferred upon you as
                            Lend-Lease Administrator by Executive Order No. 8926, dated October 28,
                            1941 and in order to enable you to arrange for Lend-Lease aid to all
                            nations already receiving aid in such manner as I shall have directed,
                            whether directly or by way of retransfer, I hereby find that the defense
                            of the following countries is vital to the defense of the United States: <list>
                                <label>1.</label>
                                <item>India, Burma, the Dominions of Australia, Canada, New Zealand
                                    and South Africa, (including mandated territories under Dominion
                                    mandate), Newfoundland, Southern Rhodesia and the British
                                    colonial dependencies (including mandated territories under
                                    British mandate).</item>
                                <label>2.</label>
                                <item>The Kingdom of Yugoslavia.</item>
                                <label>3.</label>
                                <item>The Kingdom of Egypt.”</item>
                            </list></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
